CONCLUSION: credentials.zip's garage-tools client_credentials token is
REPOSITORY-scoped (repo upload + director reads). Creating a device update
assignment (director MTU/assignment, or Platform API v2beta updates/fleets)
requires a Torizon USER session (web console or user-scoped OAuth), which is
not present in credentials.zip. The target is PUBLISHED and the device is
provisioned + polling; a single console assignment completes the update.
